<item>
  <title>FLUX persona-in-template ad generation</title>
  <dc:creator>Aja S.</dc:creator>
  <link>https://aja-ekapada.github.io/flux-persona-in-template/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ A staged search of ControlNet conditioning on FLUX.1-dev with a persona-LoRA (twenty-one sweeps, 2,716 scored rows), measured against floors, ceilings and seed noise. The ControlNet scales are the only configurations on the identity-versus-structure trade-off, and the values the search selects are one step inside the identity cliff. ]]></description>
