  <dc:creator>Aja S.</dc:creator>
  <link>https://aja-ekapada.github.io/flux-lora-likeness/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ A three-stage FLUX.1-dev LoRA hyperparameter study on one subject, scored on face_sim and image-prompt cosine_sim against two test sets: the identity/prompt-adherence trade-off is real but weak, training steps matter more than learning rate, and twenty images is the working point. ]]></description>
